msgstr "保存并应用后将删除接口 %s 及其对端。"

msgid "Peer %d"
msgstr "对端 %d"

msgid "Are you sure you want to change the IP address mode? If you are unfamiliar with the network topology, do not change it."
msgstr "确定要修改 IP 获取方式吗？如果你不熟悉网络拓扑，请勿修改。"

